  "body": "<div class=\"archive-landing\">\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-8 col-sm-push-2 guide-header\">\n<h2>Local's Guide To Austin</h2>\n<p>\nThe laid-back capital of Texas has long been a haven for countercultural types, with tattoo artists, bohemian coeds and techies biking side by side along the glistening shores of Lady Bird Lake. <em>- New York Times on Austin</em>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"guide-nav\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"guide-icons-wrapper\">\n<a class=\"guide-icons\" href=\"#music\">\n<i class=\"fa fa-music\"></i>\nMusic\n</a>\n<a class=\"guide-icons\" href=\"#food\">\n<i class=\"fa fa-cutlery\"></i>\nFood\n</a>\n<a class=\"guide-icons\" href=\"#drinks\">\n<i class=\"fa fa-beer\"></i>\nDrinks\n</a>\n<a class=\"guide-icons\" href=\"#active\">\n<i class=\"fa fa-tree\"></i>\nActive\n</a>\n<a class=\"guide-icons\" href=\"#culture\">\n<i class=\"fa fa-institution\"></i>\nCulture\n</a>\n<a class=\"guide-icons\" href=\"#places\">\n<i class=\"fa fa-map-signs\"></i>\nPlaces\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container\">\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title guide\" id=\"music\">Live Music</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"featured-guide-row\">\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/4620709b6d9d/continental-club.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Continental Club</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n1315 S Congress Ave<br />\nAustin, TX 78704\n</div>\n<p>\nFor over 60 years, the Continental Club has been at the hub of the Austin music scene. Located just south of downtown on South Congress, the venue has seen music legends everywhere from Stevie Ray Vaughan to Robert Plant take the stage and still offers nightly live music. Check out Austin legends Dale Watson and James McMurty who will be playing the week of the OpenStack Summit. \n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://continentalclub.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/HyDQm47jBvE2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/58c373e19a11/elephant-room.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Elephant Room</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n315 Congress Ave<br />\nAustin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<p>\nLocated in a basement along Congress Avenue, the Elephant Room is Austin's quintessential jazz club. With live music every night of the week (and no cover on the weekdays), this is a must stop on any local music tour. \n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://www.elephantroom.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/hTvmzzrqjoR2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/0283eee82081/white-horse.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>White Horse</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n500 Comal St<br />\nAustin, TX 78702\n</div>\n<p>\nJust east of downtown in the heart of Austin's Eastside is a little dive bar called the White Horse, one of the best live music venues in town. With everything from swing dancing lessons to a taco truck out back, this place has it all. Check out Mayeux &amp; Broussard at 10pm on April 27th. \n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://www.thewhitehorseaustin.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/98tyEBnspRB2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nMohawk\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n912 Red River St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://mohawkaustin.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/TFQurRs28BD2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nSwan Dive\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n615 Red River St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://swandiveaustin.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/DdZhdvD7PQU2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nStubb's\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n801 Red River St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.stubbsaustin.com/concert-listings\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/XjCztyoHevt\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nGeraldine's\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n605 Davis St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.geraldinesaustin.com/live-music/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/VwPVtQRsCbS2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nCheer Up Charlies\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n900 Red River St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://cheerupcharlies.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/Tv8mQZpK9J82\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nCedar Street Courtyard\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n208 W 4th St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://cedarstreetaustin.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/rr8ZFxcMYnt\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nThe Parish\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n214 E 6th St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.theparishaustin.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/QC5D88QGQM72\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nFriends\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n208 E 6th St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.friendsbar.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/iP5Sro1Hx882\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nStay Gold\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n1910 E Cesar Chavez St, Austin, TX 78702\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://staygoldaustin.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/fYZ3R5JtWz62\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nSaxon Pub\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n1320 S Lamar Blvd, Austin, TX 78704\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://thesaxonpub.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/66GtdkmvF1k\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title guide\" id=\"food\">BBQ</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"featured-guide-row\">\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/66c83c7ccb52/franklins.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Franklin's</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n900 E 11th St<br />\nAustin, TX 78702\n</div>\n<p>\nNamed best barbecue in the county by Bon Apetit and run by James Beard award winning chef Aaron Franklin, Franklin's Barbecue has sold out of their world famous brisket every day since they opened in 2009 as a food truck. Pro Tip: the line forms at 7am every day of the week (yes, four hours before they open). \n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://franklinbarbecue.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/PewTbAU8TrM2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/4b467247815d/terry-blacks.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Terry Blacks</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n1003 Barton Springs Rd<br />\nAustin, TX 78704\n</div>\n<p>\nIf lines aren't your thing, hop in a $5 Uber to Terry Black's on Barton Springs Road. Run by twin brothers from the Black family out of Lockhart, this barbecue establishment will not disappoint. \n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://terryblacksbbq.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/9FW4LJUcua32\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/88fa29e28dcf/la-bbq.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>LA BBQ</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n1906 E Cesar Chavez St<br />\nAustin, TX 78702\n</div>\n<p>\nFor those not willing/able to wait in line four hours but still want an authentic Austin barbecue experience, head down Cesar Chavez about a mile to La BBQ. Show up by 10:00am to ensure your spot towards the front of the line and be sure to order the beef ribs.\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://www.labarbecue.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/qPz6uLyjeQJ2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nStubb's\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n801 Red River St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.stubbsaustin.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/dPcBJWkbfEo\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nLambert's\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n401 W 2nd St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.lambertsaustin.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/muWEmAinpX72\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nMicklethwait's\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n1309 Rosewood Ave, Austin, TX 78702\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://craftmeatsaustin.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/mTmt1j2BxqL2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title guide\">Breakfast Tacos</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"featured-guide-row\">\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/3dae1233e234/torchys-tacos.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Torchy's Tacos (the original)</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n1311 S 1st St<br />\nAustin, TX 78704\n</div>\n<p>\nJust south of downtown on South 1st Street lives the original Torchy's Taco truck, opened in 2006 and since expanded to over 40 locations across Texas and a recently opened location in Denver. They serve breakfast and lunch/dinner options all day, but no matter what time you go, be absolutely sure to order the Green Chile Queso. \n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://torchystacos.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/PgC97yciAym\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/a3082d80b761/veracruz.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Veracruz All Natural</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n1704 E Cesar Chavez St<br />\nAustin, TX 78702\n</div>\n<p>\nVeracruz All Natural is an early example of how most of the best things in Austin began- in a trailer. With only three food truck locations around town, Veracruz is in the early stages of greatness. The homemade tortillas and salsas set them apart, and the Migas breakfast taco is one of the best tacos in town.\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://veracruztacos.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/VcRc4YCEo1w\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nTaco Shack\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n402 Brazos St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://tacoshack.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/RDu4W1MMS882\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nJuan in a Million\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n2300 E Cesar Chavez St, Austin, TX 78702\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://juaninamillion.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/bv96pRwVs5C2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nTamale House East\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n1707 E 6th St, Austin, TX 78702\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/tamalehouse.east/timeline\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/Uhr7wycwB7J2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title guide\">Quick Bites</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nEasy Tiger\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n709 E 6th St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://easytigeraustin.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/3E1Yn6Dpn7r\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nCenote\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n1010 E Cesar Chavez St, Austin, TX 78702\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://cenoteaustin.com/home/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/1wb7ePzXeRN2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nHome Slice Pizza\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n1415 S Congress Ave, Austin, TX 78704\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"https://homeslicepizza.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/tsUVqrQ8LLk\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nRoyal Blue\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://royalbluegrocery.com/locations\" target=\"_blank\">See all locations</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://royalbluegrocery.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nBlenders and Bowls\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n206 E 4th St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://blendersandbowls.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/Yw76LVTWYsj\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nGus's Fried Chicken\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n117 San Jacinto Blvd, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://gusfriedchicken.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/4i12xLGqXzu\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nTurf N Surf Poboys\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n407 Lavaca St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://lavacastreet.com/turf-n-surf\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/o3GLVV1xPL42\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title guide\">Food Trucks</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nVIA 313\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n61 Rainey St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://via313.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/kSiEEc7x7BR2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nEast Side King\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n1618 E 6th St, Austin, TX 78702\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://eskaustin.com/v2/libertybar/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/i9ahQsex16z\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title guide\">Uniquely Austin</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nCasino El Camino\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n517 E 6th St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.casinoelcamino.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/DNbe37pWg1z\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nFranks\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n407 Colorado St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://hotdogscoldbeer.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/cD6uUmahvJ52\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nAmy's ice Cream\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n1301 S Congress Ave, Austin, TX 78704\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.amysicecreams.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/nzQRs8CYUJA2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nVooDoo Donut\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n212 E 6th St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://voodoodoughnut.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/DoJPF5nMD7S2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title guide\" id=\"drinks\">Cocktail Lounges</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"featured-guide-row\">\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/f64cf4150da1/garage-bar.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Garage Bar</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n503 Colorado St<br />\nAustin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<p>\nTucked into a parking garage and recently awarded Best Cocktail in Austin, Garage Bar is one of the best kept secrets in downtown. Instead of a juke box there is a record player with a solid vinyl collection. \n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://www.garagetx.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/Fe4Py72AbfB2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/eedf775fa129/midnight-cowboy.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Midnight Cowboy</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n313 E 6th St<br />\nAustin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<p>\nThis hidden reservation-only cocktail lounge, deep in the heart of Austin's infamous 6th Street, is in the home of a former massage parlor. Book in advance, ring the bell for Harry Craddock, and be sure to order one of their tableside preparation drinks. \n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://midnightcowboymodeling.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/4KXSzq5T3S82\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/4abb3a2ded47/peche.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Péché</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n208 W 4th St<br />\nAustin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<p>\nAustin's first absinthe bar Péché is located in Downtown's Warehouse District featuring pre-Prohibition drinks and French cuisine. Stop by during happy hour all night on Sunday and Monday, and 4-7pm the rest of the week. \n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://www.pecheaustin.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/qQ7LS1TRToz\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nThe Townsend\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n718 Congress Ave #100, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://thetownsendaustin.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/6cag61BgzmH2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nFirehouse Lounge\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n605 Brazos St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.firehousehostel.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/h5Sy6wF5Hvm\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nGourdough's\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n209 W. 5th Street (between Lavaca &amp; Colorado)\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://gourdoughs.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/zGwYrtcYvmp\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title guide\">Best Dive Bars</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nJackalope\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n404 East 6th, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://jackalopebar.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/N3682FCPMvJ2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nShangri-La\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n1016 E 6th St, Austin, TX 78702\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://shangrilaaustin.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/d4hfok2fJ5p\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nDirty Bills\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n511 Rio Grande St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://dirtybillsatx.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/JyDAAibGdWQ2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nDonn's Depot\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n1600 W 5th St, Austin, TX 78703\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://donnsdepot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/XtbRTep5zoB2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title guide\" id=\"active\">Outdoor Activites</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"featured-guide-row\">\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/505040fd1c36/bat-bridge.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Bat Bridge</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\nCongress Avenue Bridge<br />\n \n</div>\n<p>\nFor most of the year, the Congress Avenue Bridge is home to North America's largest colony of bats. Up to 1.5 million Mexican free-tailed bats live under the bridge, and make a photo-worthy nightly group flight around sunset. April is a great month to catch this show! \n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/dsqCh6xUABE2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/9b28ad9651cd/peter-pan.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Peter Pan Mini Golf</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n1207 Barton Springs Rd<br />\nAustin, TX 78704\n</div>\n<p>\nFor nearly 70 years, Peter Pan mini golf has been providing guests with two 18 hole mini golf courses full of fun characters and obstacles just south of Downtown Austin. The venue is cash only ($7-11 per person) and allows drinks of all varities to be brought in for your enjoyment onsite. \n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://peterpanminigolf.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/nqdtEKnTqgq\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nButler Hike and Bike Trail at Lady Bird Lake\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nEntrance at 6th and Chavez on the northwest corner.\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.thetrailfoundation.org/explore/butler-trail-maps/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/tLKGUcLkQhA2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nB-Cycle Bike Rentals\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nThroughout downtown. Station at 4th and MetroRail has 15 docks.\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"https://austin.bcycle.com/stations/station-locations\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/AuWR7KQ4gS92\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nBarton Springs Pool\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n2201 Barton Springs Rd, Austin, TX 78746\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"https://austintexas.gov/department/barton-springs-pool\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/XZSFRRrkae52\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nCongress Avenue Kayak\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n74 Trinity St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.congresskayaks.com/home.php\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/dpSr5RyXeZH2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title guide\" id=\"active\">Indoor Fitness</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nWanderlust Yoga\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n206 East 4th Street, Austin, TX 78701 \n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://austin.wanderlustyoga.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/4kVSVLW6nTK2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nBlack Swan Yoga\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n403 Orchard St, Austin TX 78703\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"https://blackswanyoga.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/6nPvALHeRN12\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nCorepower Yoga\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n801 W. 5th Street, Austin, TX 78703\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.corepoweryoga.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/srAoPjzhAin\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nRo Fitness\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n74 Trinity St., Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.rofitness.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/5j6HryjffPE2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nCity Surf Fitness\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n1500 S Lamar Blvd Ste. 130, Austin, TX 78704\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.citysurffitness.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/rj1bPNS3NRM2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title guide\" id=\"culture\">Culture</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"featured-guide-row\">\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/89e3c0ac15a3/museum-weird.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Museum of the Weird</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n412 E 6th St<br />\nAustin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<p>\nLauded as \"America's Strangest Attraction\", East 6th Street's Musuem of the Weird is part gift shop, part curiousity attraction. Combo tickets are available for admission to both Museum of the Weird and its sister museum, Sfanthor House of Wax located on South Congress. \n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://www.museumoftheweird.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/V68Twa4t5Qv\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/f1e5c16f58cb/hope-outdoor.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>HOPE Outdoor Gallery</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n1101 Baylor St<br />\nAustin, TX 78703\n</div>\n<p>\nHead just west of downtown to check out one of the largest outdoor art galleries in the United States. This collection of graffiti and mural art is part of a project aimed at positive and educational messages. \n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/o73D8PcNVUQ2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/55389102299e/contemporary.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>The Contemporary Austin - Jones Center</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n700 Congress Ave<br />\nAustin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<p>\nOne of Austin's great art museums is located right downtown and will be hosting Mothernism by artist Lise Haller Baggesen during the Summit. \n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://www.thecontemporaryaustin.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/uCB9GKfgYyG2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nMexico-Arte Museum\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n419 Congress Ave, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.mexic-artemuseum.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/EsDbWmivsJs\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nBlanton Museum of Art\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n200 E Martin Luther King Jr Blvd, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.blantonmuseum.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/NPfCV6aWCn22\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nTexas State Capitol\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n1100 Congress Ave, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/PuK19xMHvyE2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nSfanthor House of Wax\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n1101 S Congress Ave, Austin, TX 78704\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://sfanthor.bustis.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/fHTBe6LQ5vn\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nAustin Toy Museum\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n1108 E. Cesar Chavez, Austin TX 78702\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://austintoymuseum.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/qW3vQHUPofB2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title guide\" id=\"places\">Landmarks</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"featured-guide-row\">\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/72a3e7b7e292/willie.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Willie Nelson Statue</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n301 Willie Nelson Blvd<br />\nAustin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<p>\nLocated at the corner of 2nd and Lavaca in front of the Moody Theater, home to ACL Live, the 8ft tall broze statue of Willie Nelson was unveiled in April 2012.  \n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/wfbDMyohwWD2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/9efb53b60b2c/greetings-austin.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Greetings From Austin</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n1720 S 1st St<br />\nAustin, TX 78704\n</div>\n<p>\nOne of the most iconic muralls in Austin, located just south of downtown on South 1st. Selfie approved! \n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/ka5LePY2xuR2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/c0e6e7236309/hi-frog.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Jeremiah The Innocent</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n408 W 21st St<br />\nAustin, TX 78705\n</div>\n<p>\nLocated on the main drag of the University of Texas, this mural by Daniel Johnston is most famous for being worn on a t-shirt by Kurt Cobain at the 1992 MTV Music Awards and is one of the most famous in Austin.\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/aU7LWs3WbSP2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nStevie Ray Vaughan statue\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nLady Bird Lake Trail, Austin, TX 78704\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/jrAvZW3hHYK2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nI Love You So Much mural\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n1300 S Congress Ave, Austin, TX 78704\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/fSMem5KeuQC2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nUniversity of Texas\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nSan Jacinto Blvd and 23rd\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/DWJ6owNPSHw\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title guide\" id=\"places\">Classic Austin</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"featured-guide-row\">\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/32222edf6209/broken-spoke.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Broken Spoke</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n3201 S Lamar Blvd<br />\nAustin, TX 78704\n</div>\n<p>\nAn Austin institution for over 50 years. Part restaurant, part museum, part dancehall- make the trip to South Austin for a chicken fried steak and stay for some live country music. \n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://www.brokenspokeaustintx.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/ZKqbxdLyaWq\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured\">\n<div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/summit-landing-archive/67a42faf347f/mean-eyed-cat.jpg\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"featured-content\">\n<h5>Mean Eyed Cat</h5>\n<div class=\"address\">\n1621 W 5th St<br />\nAustin, TX 78703\n</div>\n<p>\nHoused in a former chainsaw repair shop, The Mean Eyed Cat is a Johnny Cash themed bar just a mile west of Downtown. Stubb's BBQ served onsite!\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"http://themeaneyedcat.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n<a class=\"featured-site\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/sZP7MpakgQJ2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nTexas Chili Parlor\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n1409 Lavaca St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/texas-chili-parlor-austin\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/VsXbcRAYR2P2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nAllen's Boots\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n1522 S Congress Ave, Austin, TX 78704\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.allensboots.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/UjHZeAL4QZm\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nPolvo's\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n2004 S 1st St, Austin, TX 78704\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.polvosaustin.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/QaELFS2nQe42\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nGinny's Longhorn Saloon\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n5434 Burnet Rd, Austin, TX 78756\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://thelittlelonghornsaloon.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/oA57M2UWjSU2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nWaterloo Records\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n600A N Lamar Blvd, Austin, TX 78703\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.waterloorecords.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/NcnhWhtxud62\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nThe Drag\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\nGuadalupe St between 21st and 25th\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/the-drag-austin\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/fPiYimKjzKG2\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title guide\">Entertainment</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nVeleeta Room\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n521 E 6th St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<a href=\"http://www.thevelveetaroom.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>|\n<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/cSBevdnujJq\" target=\"_blank\">Map</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row guide-listing\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 guide-name\">\nAlamo Drafthouse\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n320 E 6th St, Austin, TX 78701\n</div>\n<div cla